  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a senior secured loan of up to EUR 20.08 million to JV Samarkand  England Eco-Medical LLC and Bayan Medical LLC (collectively, the Group) for the  purchase of new production lines and modernisation of the Group&apos;s existing  manufacturing facilities (Capex), the working capital (WC) needs, and balance  sheet restructuring (BSR).  The Project aims to address domestic pharmaceutical trade deficit by providing  direct financing to the Group, enabling the Group to expand production  capacity, diversity product portfolio and improve quality standards.</narrative>
  </description>
